capture log — #354 L3 read-only egui/WASM cut (synthetic evidence)
==================================================================

Synthetic-only captures of the v2 read-only fleet board (raw herdr state
tokens, repo groups + blocked pinned, recents v1 wiring in code tests; no
live daemon, no real identities). Per #304 the mobile layout is 390x844.

Build (wasm demo):
  cd clients/egui
  RUSTFLAGS="--remap-path-prefix=/Users/jirathip=/build" \
    wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir pkg --out-name corral-web
    -> Done in 21.43s (first pass; incremental rebuilds after pane-ref fix)
  cp web/index.html pkg/
  -> pkg/ = deployable static site (index.html, corral-web.js,
     corral-web_bg.wasm); pkg is generated and NOT committed.

Privacy gate (fixture + pkg):
  python3 scripts/check-demo-privacy.py clients/egui/assets/demo-fixture.json \
      clients/egui/pkg
    -> "privacy scan: 0 forbidden matches"  (exit 0)
  python3 scripts/check-demo-privacy.py --self-test \
      clients/egui/assets/demo-fixture.json
    -> all identity mutations rejected, positive controls accepted (exit 0)

Serving + capture:
  python3 -m http.server 8740   (cwd = clients/egui/pkg)
  curl http://127.0.0.1:8740/ -> 200
  chrome-headless-shell (ms-playwright cache, mac-arm64), one shot per viewport:
    --screenshot=evidence/board-demo-390x844.png --window-size=390,844 \
      --hide-scrollbars --virtual-time-budget=15000 \
      http://127.0.0.1:8740/capture.html
    --screenshot=evidence/board-demo-desktop-1280x800.png --window-size=1280,800 \
      --hide-scrollbars --virtual-time-budget=15000 \
      http://127.0.0.1:8740/capture.html
  (capture.html is a temp same-origin page that seeds localStorage
  {mode: demo, base_url: http://127.0.0.1:8474} then redirects to index.html,
  so the first-open setup panel is pre-answered; deleted with pkg/)

