#358 re-capture — idle marker U+25E6 tofu fix (2026-09-03)
==================================================================

The #354-L3 captures above show the pre-fix board: idle chips rendered the
epaint tofu replacement U+25A1 ("□ idle"; pixel-verified with vision against
the base PNG). #358 adds the toolkit's built-in Hack font to the end of the
proportional fallback chain (configure_fonts on desktop, WebCorralApp::new on
wasm — one shared theme::board_font_definitions), so U+25E6 resolves again.

Rebuild + re-capture used the SAME pipeline as the L3 run above:
  cd clients/egui
  RUSTFLAGS="--remap-path-prefix=/Users/jirathip=/build" \
    wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir pkg --out-name corral-web
    -> Done in 3m 02s
  cp web/index.html pkg/  (capture.html recreated as in the L3 run)

